
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FILECHECK.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT DAILY-TXN-FILE
        ASSIGN TO "DAILY-TXN-FILE.DAT"
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-TXN-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD DAILY-TXN-FILE.
01 TXN-RECORD PIC X(80).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-TXN-STATUS PIC XX VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PARA.

    DISPLAY "CHECKING TRANSACTION FILE..."

    OPEN INPUT DAILY-TXN-FILE

    EVALUATE WS-TXN-STATUS

        WHEN '00'
            DISPLAY "FILE OPENED SUCCESSFULLY"
            DISPLAY "STATUS: " WS-TXN-STATUS
            CLOSE DAILY-TXN-FILE
            MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE

        WHEN '35'
            DISPLAY "MISSING INPUT FILE"
            DISPLAY "STATUS: " WS-TXN-STATUS
            MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
            GOBACK

        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "FILE OPEN ERROR"
            DISPLAY "STATUS: " WS-TXN-STATUS
            MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
            GOBACK

    END-EVALUATE.

    GOBACK.


